{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "I will purify you",
    "steam_appid": 2950350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/99a9adef51ae55f2c1d354026250107c.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/99a9adef51ae55f2c1d354026250107c.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcist James sets out on a journey to purify supernatural beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All around the world, various mysterious entities with charming appearances engage James</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in fierce battles.<br><br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/024aff309030f173dbc2901e59d4d98e.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/024aff309030f173dbc2901e59d4d98e.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six boss monsters, each well-known in their respective regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They appear in the form of beautiful women with distinct personalities.<br><br>Each of them possesses powerful unique skills, so be cautious during purification!<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/0278319c0d641e338dd9761003b13f0a.avif?t=1752555312\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/43a7724312d9adefdfab01fb1258839f.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/43a7724312d9adefdfab01fb1258839f.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In I.P.U, you must fend off waves of minions and defeat powerful bosses that appear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >periodically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a 2D pixel side-scrolling action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies may attack from both close and long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They often rush in waves\u2014be especially careful at those times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/1f9f99c4c954e982d562d38db941e300.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that happens, try opening the suspicious items scattered around the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might give you a huge advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/ce8c7fe844decd94fca7de684002bbef.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a boss or leveling up, a Battle Shop will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to purchase the gear or buffs you need at that moment!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/9800f629d76f93f0c34862eda2cc7300.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mentioned earlier, bosses have powerful unique skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome their challenges through skillful tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/3018ebf72586ef9cf10773892d2912e4.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/3018ebf72586ef9cf10773892d2912e4.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br> <br>The Bunker offers players various strategic options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your account level increases, bring the beer you receive to Mr. Stan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/07e4094869823e305c72ad685999955b.avif?t=1752555312\" width=621 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can upgrade your character\u2019s stats or learn new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your upgrades to match your weapon preference or play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Made a mistake? No worries\u2014generous Mr. Stan will reset your skills for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for new weapons?<br>Visit the weapon shop run by retired veteran hunter Miss. Lee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/c1e42c480e6dbbe12ba625929ff1e6b4.avif?t=1752555312\" width=621 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find powerful upgraded weapons and hidden gear here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also prepare weapons for your next dungeon challenge in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Miss. Lee occasionally runs sales\u2014so don\u2019t forget to check in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the Hunter Network, you can unlock and play as new playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/824bab10b4600cdccebad69ddde1e149.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new hunters all have different skills and powerful unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enhance them further using awakening items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may not know who\u2019s the strongest,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but you\u2019ll definitely find the one that fits your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/99a9adef51ae55f2c1d354026250107c.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/99a9adef51ae55f2c1d354026250107c.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcist James sets out on a journey to purify supernatural beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All around the world, various mysterious entities with charming appearances engage James</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in fierce battles.<br><br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/024aff309030f173dbc2901e59d4d98e.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/024aff309030f173dbc2901e59d4d98e.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six boss monsters, each well-known in their respective regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They appear in the form of beautiful women with distinct personalities.<br><br>Each of them possesses powerful unique skills, so be cautious during purification!<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/0278319c0d641e338dd9761003b13f0a.avif?t=1752555312\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/43a7724312d9adefdfab01fb1258839f.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/43a7724312d9adefdfab01fb1258839f.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In I.P.U, you must fend off waves of minions and defeat powerful bosses that appear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >periodically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a 2D pixel side-scrolling action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies may attack from both close and long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They often rush in waves\u2014be especially careful at those times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/1f9f99c4c954e982d562d38db941e300.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that happens, try opening the suspicious items scattered around the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might give you a huge advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/ce8c7fe844decd94fca7de684002bbef.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a boss or leveling up, a Battle Shop will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to purchase the gear or buffs you need at that moment!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/9800f629d76f93f0c34862eda2cc7300.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mentioned earlier, bosses have powerful unique skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome their challenges through skillful tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/3018ebf72586ef9cf10773892d2912e4.poster.avif?t=1752555312\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/3018ebf72586ef9cf10773892d2912e4.webm?t=1752555312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br> <br>The Bunker offers players various strategic options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your account level increases, bring the beer you receive to Mr. Stan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/07e4094869823e305c72ad685999955b.avif?t=1752555312\" width=621 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can upgrade your character\u2019s stats or learn new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your upgrades to match your weapon preference or play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Made a mistake? No worries\u2014generous Mr. Stan will reset your skills for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for new weapons?<br>Visit the weapon shop run by retired veteran hunter Miss. Lee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/c1e42c480e6dbbe12ba625929ff1e6b4.avif?t=1752555312\" width=621 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find powerful upgraded weapons and hidden gear here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also prepare weapons for your next dungeon challenge in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Miss. Lee occasionally runs sales\u2014so don\u2019t forget to check in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the Hunter Network, you can unlock and play as new playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/824bab10b4600cdccebad69ddde1e149.avif?t=1752555312\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new hunters all have different skills and powerful unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enhance them further using awakening items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may not know who\u2019s the strongest,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but you\u2019ll definitely find the one that fits your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
